@startuml
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName "Liberation Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam titleFontStyle bold
skinparam legendBorderColor black
skinparam legendBorderThickness 2.5
skinparam legendBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam legendFontSize 17

title RoomieSync - System Event Response Table

legend top
|= Event |= Trigger |= Source |= Action / Process Description |= System Output |= Destination / Data Store |
| User Registration | Registration form submitted | User (AuthPage) | POST /api/auth/register; hash password with bcrypt; initialize user doc | Active user session token | MongoDB users collection |
| User Login | Credentials submitted | User (AuthPage) | POST /api/auth/login; verify bcrypt hash; emit socket user_online | Authenticated session token | MongoDB users / Socket.IO |
| Profile Update | Profile form saved | User (ProfilePage) | PUT /api/profile/:userId; update lifestyle criteria & budget preferences | Updated profile document | MongoDB profiles collection |
| View Matches | Matching page loaded | System Engine | calculateCompatibility(); compute weighted compatibility score (budget 25, food 20, sleep 20, etc.) | Ranked roommate match list | React UI (MatchingPage) |
| Send Friend Request | "Match / Connect" clicked | User (MatchingPage) | POST /api/friend-requests; validate unique sender-recipient pair; emit socket alert | Pending friend request doc | MongoDB friendrequests / Recipient socket |
| Accept Friend Request | "Accept" clicked | Recipient (ChatPage) | PUT /api/friend-requests/:id/accept; create conversation entity with 2 participants | Active conversation channel | MongoDB conversations collection |
| Browse Properties | Filters changed | User (PropertiesPage) | GET /api/properties; client/server filtering by budget, location, and type | Verified property catalog | React UI (PropertiesPage) |
| Book Property Visit | Visit form submitted | User (PropertyModal) | POST /api/properties/book; validate date; mark status 'Confirmed' | Booking record & email alert | MongoDB bookings / Landlord panel |
| Landlord Add Listing | New listing submitted | Landlord (OwnerPanel) | POST /api/properties; store amenities, location, photos; status 'pending' | New property document | MongoDB properties collection |
| Subscribe Meal Plan | Meal plan chosen | User (MealPlansPage) | POST /api/meals/subscribe; link subscriber to daily tiffin menu | Subscription record | MongoDB subscriptions collection |
| Log Shared Expense | Expense form saved | User (ExpenseTracker) | POST /api/expenses; calculate equal/custom splits; notify co-tenants | Split expense entry | MongoDB expenses collection |
| Create Rental Agreement | Booking finalized | Roommate A & B | POST /api/agreements; compile house rules, 50/50 rent share, security deposit | Signed digital agreement PDF | MongoDB agreements collection |
| Send Real-Time Chat | Message sent | User (ChatWindow) | emit("send_message"); persist Message document; update conversation timestamp | Real-time chat message | MongoDB messages / Recipient socket |
| Mark Message Read | Conversation opened | Recipient (ChatWindow) | emit("message_read"); bulk-update isRead flags; notify sender | Read receipt double-check | MongoDB messages / Sender socket |
| Submit Review | Review submitted | User (ReviewForm) | POST /api/reviews; record rating and commentary for target entity | New review record | MongoDB reviews collection |
| Report User / Content | Report form submitted | User (ReportModal) | POST /api/reports; log target ID, reporter ID, rationale; set 'Under Review' | Flagged abuse ticket | MongoDB reports collection |
| Admin Verify Landlord | Verification toggled | Admin (AdminDashboard) | PUT /api/users/:id/verify; set isVerified: true | Verified account badge | MongoDB users collection |
| Admin Moderate Report | Resolution selected | Admin (AdminDashboard) | PUT /api/reports/:id; execute ban, content purge, or dismissal | Resolved audit status | MongoDB reports / Target user doc |
endlegend

@enduml